      "notes": "Uses authored variant A card LOD2, UV-preserving planar dissolve then collapse. Original files kept in ignored raw folder; fetch-reference-trees.py verifies source MD5 and records SHA256. Source float3 UVMap converted to FBX loop UV where required. Pine twig color uses official JPEG RGB because the PNG contains invalid white RGB under embedded transparency, which becomes visible when packing standalone opacity.",
